{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/bo-rou-diao.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-06-44", "entity": "薄肉雕", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:f82636760045f1dfbb0bea7e7f63ea76afd4fe5fd5057c7b11c539310fca91da", "bytes": 3867, "lines": 79, "note": "新建sculpture_technique：北朝（麦积山语境）；麦积山上七佛阁长廊上方以薄肉雕表现飞天，将浮雕与绘画结合；因衣裙飘带飞舞、鲜花散浮而称散花楼"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/guan-gang-fa.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-06-57", "entity": "灌钢法", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:599c2030786891382ff021569af1617cac0c80c38330fdb35c97290b591a5509", "bytes": 3440, "lines": 76, "note": "新建metalworking_technique：隋唐（仅记推广）；因鼓风与炼炉的出现，灌钢法在隋唐得以推广；来源只有一句，未给原料、配比与操作"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/ta-ben.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-06-87", "entity": "拓本", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:732bbe7cef5d75f4c1d08a8a1dd42d22c7074ad9afd7abbbd7dd5b9a3298d730", "bytes": 3685, "lines": 77, "note": "新建reproduction_technique：隋唐（来源语境）；造纸水平提高与纸张应用使拓本技术出现有了可能，并为印刷术产生提供必要条件"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/huozi-yinshua.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-07-146", "entity": "活字印刷", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:e552711a7cf5e9deb5222e42a446af2c9ba0e46adc7ec4b342a856e9b3af1a54", "bytes": 6641, "lines": 94, "note": "新建printing_technique：北宋庆历年间；胶泥刻字、火烧成陶质单字，铁版排字，松脂蜡与纸灰固定，平板压平；双版更互，木格按韵贮字"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/fu-shao-fa.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-08-132", "entity": "覆烧法", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:6ed2d6e88bda0acac48c669c0d508a581d325fb658bcb17a5847ca7624b068a2", "bytes": 4968, "lines": 87, "note": "新建ceramic_technique：北宋中期；宋代景德镇仿定窑；定窑将瓷坯反扣于垫圈上，组装大型匣钵，增加装烧数量以提高产量和质量；景德镇在拉坯、过内范、修足等工序中仿定窑覆烧并形成自身技术特点"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/zao-jia.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-08-205", "entity": "造甲", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:63026484d5975543b5d9099d5d3a4debf8514355f038e643390d9683ed3d10bd", "bytes": 3678, "lines": 78, "note": "新建armor_making：宋代；铠甲五十步强弩不能入；箭矢仅能自缀孔钻穿，钻空刮铁使箭头反卷，见其坚硬"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/zao-jian.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-08-206", "entity": "造剑", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:d040bd2f06227b4a568482ec550c3792ed76c1303136c75a48a05291443ee9e6", "bytes": 3618, "lines": 80, "note": "新建metalworking_technique：宋代；造剑不用太钢劲的钢材，剑身以柔铁为主，百炼成钢化为绕指柔，以弹力和韧性为特色"}
{"action": "create", "target_ref": "04-knowledge/units/procedures/tao-se-yinshua.md", "candidate_id": "2009-zhaonong-zhongguo-yishu-shejishi:cand-09-14", "entity": "套色印刷", "before": null, "after_sha256": "sha256:9249cd262945e30d205d86cebaa84aea7f04c1d4e6f02193630fbec0e2342a2e", "bytes": 3754, "lines": 82, "note": "新建printing_technique：元代（1341）；1341 年中兴路无闻和尚《金刚经注》扉页黑红套色图画，经文红色正文、黑色注文"}
